Package: protonforge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6core6 (>= 6.0.0), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.0.0), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.0.0), libqt6network6 (>= 6.0.0), libc6 (>= 2.34), zlib1g, libqt6keychain1
Maintainer: ProtonForge <noreply@protonforge.dev>
Description: DLSS & Proton Manager for Steam and GOG games
 ProtonForge is a Qt6 application for managing NVIDIA DLSS settings
 and Proton versions for Windows games on Linux. It handles Steam
 libraries and GOG accounts side by side; since there is no GOG client
 for Linux, it downloads and installs those games itself. Neither store
 is required for the other, and Proton can be managed with no Steam
 installed at all.
 .
 Features:
  - Configure DLSS Super Resolution, Ray Reconstruction, and Frame Generation
  - HDR support configuration for Wayland
  - Direct game launch with custom settings
  - Proton-CachyOS and Proton-GE management
  - Per-game settings persistence
  - Frame rate limiting for smooth motion
  - GOG library browsing, installing, updating and uninstalling
  - Game artwork for both stores
Homepage: https://github.com/theinvisible/proton-forge
